1
00:00:00,167 --> 00:00:01,767
[MUSIC: Two-note mystery motif]

2
00:00:01,292 --> 00:00:06,012
NARRATOR: Arsenal. New season. Same bottle.

3
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:10,500
[MUSIC: Samtoons signature]

4
00:00:13,250 --> 00:00:15,850
ARTETA: This year, no excuses.

5
00:00:16,070 --> 00:00:17,800
ARTETA: I'm lifting that trophy,

6
00:00:17,870 --> 00:00:19,570
ARTETA: not applauding somebody else!

7
00:00:22,708 --> 00:00:23,648
ARTETA: Bottles?

8
00:00:23,728 --> 00:00:25,378
ARTETA: Three years finishing second,

9
00:00:25,378 --> 00:00:27,108
ARTETA: and you've made us a subscription?

10
00:00:27,875 --> 00:00:30,425
DRIVER: Automatic renewal, boss.

11
00:00:30,535 --> 00:00:32,155
DRIVER: Cancel any time.

12
00:00:32,215 --> 00:00:33,475
DRIVER: Preferably before April.

13
00:00:34,333 --> 00:00:35,533
ARTETA: Hello, board?

14
00:00:35,573 --> 00:00:37,033
ARTETA: Buy me Gyökeres.

15
00:00:37,173 --> 00:00:38,483
ARTETA: A proper striker.

16
00:00:38,573 --> 00:00:39,433
ARTETA: Someone who finishes!

17
00:00:40,958 --> 00:00:43,608
NARRATOR: So they bought a striker.

18
00:00:43,658 --> 00:00:46,078
NARRATOR: Someone to finish the chances.

19
00:00:48,083 --> 00:00:50,403
ARTETA: Meet our real striker.

20
00:00:53,458 --> 00:00:55,058
GYÖKERES: Then why am I here?

21
00:00:55,542 --> 00:00:56,942
ARTETA: Win us corners.

22
00:00:57,022 --> 00:00:58,062
ARTETA: That's where we score.

23
00:00:59,250 --> 00:01:00,300
ARTETA: Don't shoot!

24
00:01:00,350 --> 00:01:01,210
ARTETA: Hit the defender.

25
00:01:01,210 --> 00:01:03,170
ARTETA: Off him, out for a corner!

26
00:01:07,125 --> 00:01:08,675
ARTETA: Perfect. A corner!

27
00:01:08,765 --> 00:01:10,005
ARTETA: Now we can actually score.

28
00:01:12,834 --> 00:01:15,334
NARRATOR: Their attacking philosophy?

29
00:01:16,034 --> 00:01:17,384
NARRATOR: Win a corner.

30
00:01:17,634 --> 00:01:19,874
NARRATOR: Somebody’s forehead will do the rest.

31
00:01:23,959 --> 00:01:25,659
ARTETA: One nil! That’s enough football.

32
00:01:25,659 --> 00:01:26,839
ARTETA: Everybody back!

33
00:01:34,334 --> 00:01:35,934
NARRATOR: Lovely.

34
00:01:36,684 --> 00:01:40,134
NARRATOR: A goalkeeper protecting nine defenders.

35
00:01:41,542 --> 00:01:43,242
[MUSIC: Choir of approval]

36
00:01:46,459 --> 00:01:47,979
GYÖKERES: What am I supposed to do?

37
00:01:48,959 --> 00:01:50,159
ARTETA: Win another corner!

38
00:01:52,167 --> 00:01:53,767
[MUSIC: Two-note mystery motif]

39
00:01:54,375 --> 00:01:56,215
ARTETA: Nobody is getting past us.

40
00:01:58,375 --> 00:01:59,275
ARTETA: Again?

41
00:01:59,425 --> 00:02:00,825
ARTETA: We’ve built a fortress…

42
00:02:01,075 --> 00:02:03,575
ARTETA: and City are still right behind us.

43
00:02:04,125 --> 00:02:06,845
NARRATOR: And Pep had started warming up.

44
00:02:08,587 --> 00:02:11,767
ARTETA: City won again. They are right behind us!

45
00:02:11,767 --> 00:02:14,507
ARTETA: We are NOT handing Pep first place this year!

46
00:02:15,087 --> 00:02:16,587
[MUSIC: The title chase]

47
00:02:15,707 --> 00:02:17,887
NARRATOR: Arsenal were leading the league.

48
00:02:17,887 --> 00:02:21,947
NARRATOR: Unfortunately, they had seen what happens
when Pep starts following them.

49
00:02:22,747 --> 00:02:24,907
ARTETA: He’s only walking. We’re fine.

50
00:02:27,377 --> 00:02:30,657
ARTETA: We are sprinting! How is he getting closer?

51
00:02:31,457 --> 00:02:34,337
PEP: You always get tired around this part, Mikel.

52
00:02:35,167 --> 00:02:39,407
COURIER: Your annual second-place delivery! Same shelf
as last time?

53
00:02:40,207 --> 00:02:43,647
ARTETA: Cancel the subscription! We are winning it
this year!

54
00:02:44,457 --> 00:02:45,657
ARTETA: Keep hold of the lead!

55
00:02:48,087 --> 00:02:52,887
REFEREE: He has pulled him down inside the box.
Penalty against Arsenal!

56
00:02:53,457 --> 00:02:54,957
[MUSIC: Telephone hold music]

57
00:02:53,707 --> 00:02:56,507
RECORDED VOICE: For a penalty against Arsenal, please
hold.

58
00:02:58,587 --> 00:03:04,507
OPERATOR: Mikel! Our priority customer. What can we
cancel today?

59
00:03:05,337 --> 00:03:08,977
ARTETA: That penalty against us. Make it disappear.

60
00:03:08,977 --> 00:03:11,417
ARTETA: Same service as the rest of the season.

61
00:03:12,207 --> 00:03:13,817
OPERATOR: Penalty cancelled.

62
00:03:13,817 --> 00:03:17,007
OPERATOR: Would you like an Arsenal corner as a
complimentary extra?

63
00:03:17,837 --> 00:03:19,997
ARTETA: Now that is customer service.

64
00:03:22,047 --> 00:03:26,447
OPERATOR: Decision: no penalty. Corner to Arsenal.

65
00:03:26,747 --> 00:03:29,147
REFEREE: But Arsenal committed the foul!

66
00:03:29,457 --> 00:03:31,617
OPERATOR: And Arsenal will take the corner.

67
00:03:32,787 --> 00:03:35,527
NARRATOR: One goal would make Arsenal champions.

68
00:03:35,527 --> 00:03:38,627
NARRATOR: Their entire season had come down to another
corner.

69
00:03:39,457 --> 00:03:41,537
GYÖKERES: Do I finally get to shoot?

70
00:03:41,837 --> 00:03:43,677
ARTETA: No. Stand there.

71
00:03:44,337 --> 00:03:45,737
[MUSIC: Two-note mystery motif]

72
00:03:44,497 --> 00:03:48,977
NARRATOR: Come on. There is still time for Arsenal to
bottle this.

73
00:03:49,787 --> 00:03:54,747
GYÖKERES: You signed a striker, Mikel! When do I
actually get to shoot?

74
00:04:00,587 --> 00:04:04,667
GYÖKERES: My first title-winning goal, and I did not
even face the goal?

75
00:04:04,957 --> 00:04:06,397
ARTETA: Exactly as rehearsed.

76
00:04:07,207 --> 00:04:10,167
COURIER: Then where am I taking all these second-place
medals?

77
00:04:10,497 --> 00:04:15,137
ARTETA: Etihad Pharmacy. Ask for Pep. He will need
something for the pain.

78
00:04:16,337 --> 00:04:18,657
ARTETA: Nobody deserves this more than you.

79
00:04:23,997 --> 00:04:24,707
[MUSIC: The familiar two notes]

80
00:04:24,707 --> 00:04:25,907
[MUSIC: The final note]

81
00:04:26,287 --> 00:04:28,887
FERGUSON: I SAID I WAS RETIRED!

82
00:04:28,887 --> 00:04:33,427
FERGUSON: Now Arsenal have won the league with a
CORNER FLAG and a BACKSIDE!

83
00:04:33,427 --> 00:04:36,377
FERGUSON: STOP GIVING ME REASONS TO COME BACK!

84
00:04:39,417 --> 00:04:51,417
[MUSIC: Samtoons outro]
